B.aaH={"Visual HTML version: 2026-08-22B":0,"Privacy Policy":1,"Privacy Policy for T-G-Apps LLC apps, games, websites, and related services.":2,"Effective Date: June 2, 2026":3,"T-G-Apps LLC (&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;our,&rdquo; or &ldquo;us&rdquo;) respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected, used, and shared when you use our mobile applications, games, websites, and related services.":4,"Covered Products":5,"Related websites and online services":6,"1. Information We Collect":7,"Our Services may collect limited information automatically through third-party service providers.":8,"Device type":9,"Operating system version":10,"Mobile advertising identifiers":11,"IP address":12,"Approximate geographic region":13,"App usage information":14,"Crash reports and diagnostics":15,"Ad interaction information":16,"We generally do not collect personally identifying information such as your real name, physical address, or phone number unless you voluntarily provide it.":17,"2. Advertising":18,"Our Services may display advertisements provided by third-party advertising partners, including Google AdMob.":19,"Advertising providers may use cookies, mobile advertising identifiers, and similar technologies to deliver advertisements, measure ad performance, limit repetitive advertisements, and personalize advertising content.":20,"Google may collect and process data in accordance with its own privacy policies.":21,"Google Privacy Policy":22,"How Google Uses Information from Sites and Apps":23,"3. Analytics and Diagnostics":24,"We may use third-party analytics or crash reporting services to improve our Services. These services may collect device information, usage statistics, error reports, and performance diagnostics.":25,"This information helps us improve game stability, usability, and performance.":26,"4. Cookies and Similar Technologies":27,"Our websites and advertising providers may use cookies, local storage, mobile advertising identifiers, and similar technologies to remember preferences, measure website traffic, support advertising functionality, and improve user experience.":28,"Users may disable cookies through browser settings, though some features may not function properly.":29,"5. Children&#39;s Privacy":30,"Our Services are intended for a general audience. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under the age of 13. If we become aware that personal information from a child under 13 has been collected improperly, we will take reasonable steps to delete such information.":31,"Parents who believe their child has provided personal information may contact us using the information below.":32,"6. Data Sharing":33,"We do not sell personal information. We may share limited data with advertising providers, analytics providers, hosting providers, and legal authorities when required by law.":34,"Such sharing is limited to what is reasonably necessary to operate and improve the Services.":35,"7. Data Security":36,"We take reasonable measures to help protect information associated with our Services. However, no method of electronic transmission or storage is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.":37,"8. Third-Party Links and Services":38,"Our Services may contain links to third-party websites or services. We are not responsible for the privacy practices of third-party providers. Users should review the privacy policies of those third parties separately.":39,"9. Your Rights and Choices":40,"Depending on your location, you may have rights regarding access to information, deletion requests, restricting certain data processing, and advertising preferences.":41,"Many mobile devices allow users to reset or limit advertising identifiers through device settings.":42,"10. Changes to This Privacy Policy":43,"We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. Changes become effective when posted on this page. Continued use of the Services after updates constitutes acceptance of the revised policy.":44,"11. Contact Information":45,"Contact Email:":46,[u.q]:47,"Visual HTML version: 2026-08-30A":48,"T-G-Apps Game Catalog":49,"Current and in-production T-G-Apps games and their intended audiences.":50,"Audience Policy":51,[u.O]:52,"Current Apps":53,"Dice scorecard strategy":54,"A dice strategy game with human and robot players, scorecard decisions, animated dice, music, backgrounds, and game history.":55,"Current app":56,"Children &amp; Adults":57,"No wagering":58,"A blackjack game with dealer play, robot opponents, casino-style betting, chips, insurance, and configurable table rules.":59,"Adults 13+":60,"Simulated betting":61,"Texas Hold&#39;em poker":62,"A Texas Hold&#39;em poker game with human and robot players, betting rounds, chips, community cards, and showdown play.":63,"Seven-card stud poker":64,"A fixed-limit stud poker game with private and exposed cards, betting rounds, chips, and human or robot opponents.":65,"Seven-card draw poker":66,"A seven-card draw-poker game with betting, chips, card exchange, and robot strategy.":67,"In Production":68,"Five-card draw poker":69,"Classic draw poker centered on a single five-card hand, opening betting, one draw, final betting, and standard hand rankings.":70,"In production":71,"Domino tile strategy":72,"A phone-friendly dominoes game built around matching tiles, blocking play, tactical scoring, and clear shared-table presentation.":73,"Mahjong tile strategy":74,"Six mahjong games: Hong Kong, Riichi, Chinese Official, Taiwanese, Sichuan, and Solitaire, with robot opponents, hints, and game history.":75,"A cribbage game covering the deal, discard to the crib, pegging, hand counting, and the race to the winning score.":76,"A trick-taking game focused on avoiding penalty cards, tracking played suits, and deciding when to attempt shooting the moon.":77,"A partnership trick-taking game planned around bidding, making contracts, managing bags, and coordinating through card play.":78,"A fast partnership card game covering trump selection, bowers, trick strategy, going alone, and concise round scoring.":79,"Farkle dice":80,"A push-your-luck dice game planned around scoring combinations, banking points, reroll decisions, and the risk of a scoreless turn.":81,Back:82,"Return to Game":83}
